    "title": "Coroner identifies motorcyclist killed in Christmas Eve crash in Inman - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Scott ,\n4 hours ago INMAN, S.C. (FOX Carolina) - The Spartanburg County Coroner’s Office reports a motorcyclist was killed in a crash involving an SUV on Christmas Eve. The South Carolina Highway Patrol said a 2014 Audi SUV was traveling west on US 176 when it tried to turn left onto a private drive and collided with a 2007 Suzuki motorcycle traveling east near Grandview Drive at 4:09 p.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
